# OPERATIONS §2.3 (M3) "`ok` isn't a clean run. REQ-ASK, REQ-CLOCK, holes and per-value refusals come only from
# run": q states a cut after the model's on (run refuses the request, REQ-CLOCK, E §11) and h reads an input no
# version gives (a hole at run). check evaluates and walks nothing, so the reality loads: `ok`, exit 0.
=== options check exit=0
=== model.tally
model household
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2027-12-31
  note "a model that loads and whose run refuses (invented)"

source card "a card (invented)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input amt: money PLN
input rent: money PLN

ask q: amt as known 2026-06-01
ask h: rent law 2026-03-01

version card_2026
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "the card"
=== expect
ok
